			"notes": "## Minecraft 26.3 support\n\nAdds a 26.3 build with Java 25, Fabric Loader 0.19.5+, and Fabric API 0.161.0+26.3. Minecraft 1.21 / 1.21.1 remains supported.\n\nUpdates the region map, dynamic textures, backup screen, permissions, and network payloads. Left click selects a region, right/middle click pans, and the scroll wheel zooms using 26.3's SDL input values.\n\nFixed disconnect cleanup to release map textures on the render thread. Existing configuration, copy records, queue, backups, and map cache are retained. Updating the mod does not automatically copy regions.\n\nAll 125 tests passed for both supported builds. Real server/client checks verified restart persistence, terrain tiles, map selection and queue networking, panning/zooming, backup UI, and clean disconnect."
		},
